desc:AmiSynth Drums (19 synthesized parts, GM notes)
//tags: instrument drum
//author: AmiSynth
// Port of src/dsp/drums.js. Notes: 36 kick, 37 rimshot, 38 snare, 39 clap, 42 closed hat,
// 45/47/50 toms, 46 open hat (choked by 42), 49 crash, 51 ride, 56 cowbell, 70 shaker,
// 54 tambourine, 63 conga, 65 timbale, 67 agogo, 75 claves, 81 triangle; the other GM notes
// play variants of these (GM_DRUM_VARIANTS in params.js); 58, 71-74, 78, 79 are silent.

// <generated sliders>
